  "description": "Syncfusion® ASP.NET Core HeatMap Chart is a data visualization control that represents data in a matrix form using color coding to indicate the magnitude of values. It supports various color mapping modes (gradient, fixed), cell type rendering (rect, bubble, pie), row and column labels, legends, tooltips, data binding from array and JSON sources, and responsive design. It is widely used for displaying patterns in large datasets such as activity maps, calendar heatmaps, and correlation matrices in ASP.NET Core applications.",
